### Firebase.json (Hosting, en `frontend/`)

```json
{
  "hosting": {
    "site": "turnobot-web",
    "public": "dist",
    "ignore": [
      "firebase.json",
      "**/.*",
      "**/node_modules/**"
    ],
    "rewrites": [
      { "source": "**", "destination": "/index.html" }
    ]
  }
}
```

